<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">- Kuman New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Jems</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jems</para>
  <para style="toc1">Jems</para>
  <para style="mt">Jems</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1" />
  <para style="s">Ka bre</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1" />Na Jems, God ya nono Yaglno Kade Jisas Krais niglno kogono yagl ta moglka i, pepa magigl i boglka. Na pepa boglka i, ene Israel yoba yugobuno 12-pela moglsre, uglo koglo koglo bage bage meglkwa i, bogl teiga. Na ene wakai we di teiga.<verse eid="JAS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yubun kane kane ugwa i, nono si gigle di norabuka pre ugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2" />Agrama abarama wagle, yubun kane kane ene meglmara ta plau dinan, ene gun keme yeio. <verse eid="JAS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3" />I siragl pre ene pre kan erikwa i, yubun ugwa i, ene pre mediglkwa gigle dumo mo di, ere kanagledi ugwa ba ene ta yage sikribi, ene pre mediglkwa i, si gigle di togwa mere yegl paugwa.<verse eid="JAS 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4" />Si gigle di tenan, ene yake ede pi yoba mere yegl moglsre, kaglno mina adigl moraiglkwa. Kaglno mina adigl meglbi, ene God kogonmo ta eraiglmara i, ege swara ta yobuglno dokokrabuka pre ibun unabuka i, ene kanige erio.<verse eid="JAS 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba nomane wakai ta inagledi pran, ye kamage erabuka paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5" />Ana ene meglmara swarano ta nomane wakai paikran, nomane wakai pre God agle di pro! God agle di pitn, ye ene nomane wakai tenabuka. I siragl pre yoba God agle di prikwa i, ye ka tekre, yoba mudu taragl wakai wakai norukwa yagle moglkwa. <verse eid="JAS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6" />Ba ene God agle di pratnga igne, ene ye pre medigl moglsre, nomane suo suo ikro. I siragl pre yoba ta kina suo yogwa i, ir ugo, mudi nigl pebigl di ede meda, suna omere mere yegl, ye nomane kane kane idre, adigl gigledi moglkrukwa. <verse eid="JAS 1:6" /><verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7-8" />Yoba yegl ta morabuka i, ege ege kina suo yogo, ege mere yage sugwa ta moglkwa pre ye Yagl Kade agle di prabuka igne, na Yagl Kade di teimere yegl ta ere narabiwe di prikrabuka paugwa.<verse eid="JAS 1:7-8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Goduglme ya yoba taragl mere kan neigwa pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9" />Ana nono agro goduglme ta morabuka i, God na ake mitna edumedi prisre, gun yenabuka paugwa. <verse eid="JAS 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10" />Ba agro ta mige moni mere kan nenabuka i, God ye ta ake atne edenan, gun yenabuka paugwa. I siragl pre kugl kwie ege sugunagle ta padre, tabre goglmere yegl, agro i ama ege sugunagle yegl moglsre, goraglka pamedi prabuka paugwa. <verse eid="JAS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11" />Ade ede mitna ogo, niga podo dugwa igne, kugl tabre yamunugo, kwiemo ama yage si, goglko, yoba okuo wakai kankrimere mere yegl, yoba ta mige moni mere kan nenabuka i, ye kogon kane kane ere morabara i, ere kodokre, tabre gorabuka.<verse eid="JAS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">God yoba tadaglme eraiglmedi ake nu sikrukwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12" />Yoba ta yubun mina adigl gigledi morabuka i, ye gun yenabuka paugwa. I siragl pre ye wakai erukwa pre God ye wakai erumedi kandre, topo wakai tenabuka. Topo i, king bitno gagl mere yegl yogwa, kagie kor kaima meglkwa bitno gagl we digwa. Yoba ta deno muduno God teigwa i, God ye topo yegl tenagledi promis ere kodugwa.<verse eid="JAS 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13" />Ana yoba ta tadaglme ye dem muduo mina pogglau boran, ye God di boglsre, God na tadaglme eratnedi erumiwe di, yegl ta dikrabuka paugwa. I siragl pre God moglkwa i, mabuno kide ta ye dem muduo mina pogglau boglkruko, te ye yoba swara ta mabuno kide erabedi erekrukwa. <verse eid="JAS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14" />Ba mabuno kide yoba swara swarade deno muduno mina pogglau boglkwa igne, ye yene mabuno kide gun yei teigwa pre ye nomane kide idre, yage sigwa. <verse eid="JAS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15" />Ana yoba mabuno kide gun yei teigwa igne, ye pre moglsre, okuo tadaglme erikwa. Te, tadaglme ere ede eigwa igne, geglkwa mabuno ama ede nogugl ugwa.<verse eid="JAS 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16" />Agrama abarama wagle, na dena muduna suna meglkwa i, yoba ta ene bakagl te dinaiglmiwa, ene kan kun erio. <verse eid="JAS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17" />Nono taragl wakai kane kane ta imga i, heven ibo yedre keme ede atne wigwa. Neno Kade, ye taragl kane kane kamin mitna ibo pai, abuglage sinaiglmedi ere yogwa yagle moglkwa i, ye taragl wakai keme norukwa. Nono kamga, ade ede wogwa igne, taragl kwiano ede olto sugunagle ogo, kamga. Ba God yegl ta moglkrukwa. Ye moglmere mogl pai moglsre, taragl wakai keme norukwa. <verse eid="JAS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18" />God okna yene wakai prumere ere mogl, ye kamo kaima i mina nono ere i kor edugo, erme nono ye taraglmo mere yegl munga. God taragl kane kane ere yogwa i, okuo u wakai pidre, yene taraglmo yenabere mere yegl, nono erme kuade ede okna pidre, God taraglmo mere yegl mogl kodumga.<verse eid="JAS 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">God kamo prisre, duglo boramga paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19" />Ana agrama abarama wagle, na dena muduna suna meglkwa i, ene prio! Ene mudu mabuno ta eraiglkwa paugwa i, yoba pere ka dinaiglkwa i wakai ere kinano gudu praiglkwa ba ene tabre di ikne edekrio! Te, ene deno tabre kubrokraiglkwa paugwa. <verse eid="JAS 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20" />I siragl pre yoba deno kubrikwa igne, God mabunomo du paugwa i, ta i nogugl edekrikwa.<verse eid="JAS 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21" />Yegl pre mabuno deglbi yenabuka ya mabuno kide tau pai morabuka i, ene kide kodidre, mogl atne ede, God kamo ta ene deno muduno suna padigl te kodugwa i, duglo boraiglkwa paugwa. God kamo swara i, ene ere inan, ene kor moraiglkwa i, kuno erabuka.<verse eid="JAS 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22" />Ana ene God kamo praiglkwa ba dumere ta erekribi, ene enene bakaiglkwa mere yegl panabuka pre ye dumere eraiglkwa paugwa. <verse eid="JAS 1:22" /><verse number="23-24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23-24" />I siragl pre yoba ta God kamo prisre, dumere erekran, ye yoba ta yene gumano drano glas mina kandre, ede bage ta eigwa igne tabre torua sumere yegl mere moglkwa. <verse eid="JAS 1:23-24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25" />Ba yoba ta lo wakai kaima ta paugwa, nono kane pai dinaiglmedi ake ple di norukwa lo i, tabre kiurekrabuka ba wakai ere prisre, duglo bogl moran, ye kogon erabara i mina God ere wakai ere tenabuka.<verse eid="JAS 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26" />Ana yoba ta ere mogl, ka mabuno prie dinabuka ba ye dra sugl wakai moglkre, ka kide di moran, ye nomanemo mina ye yene bakaglkwa mere yegl paugwa. Ye ka mabuno prukwa i, u yoko kaima ogwa. <verse eid="JAS 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27" />Ka mabuno prikwa yoba mabuno kaima boraiglkwa i yegl mere paugwa, yoba ta gak mua ya abu werai yubun imara pi kandre, ere wakai ere tedre, mabuno kide makandigle yoba erikwa i, ye ta ere dinamnedi eraiglkwa i, Neno Kade God gumuglo mina ye ka prikwa i du kaima paugo, aglauno ta paikrumedi kanugwa.<verse eid="JAS 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2" />
  <para style="s">Nono yoba mudu mabuno swara keme ere tenamga paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1" />Agrama abarama wagle, nono Yaglno Kade Jisas Krais, kagie podo kide kaima paugwa i, ene ye pre medigl moglsre, yoba mudu mabuno swara keme ere teo. Ene yoba tau mogl mitna edimedi kandre, yoba tau mogl atne edimedi kandre, yegl ta erekrio. <verse eid="JAS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2" />Ene makai si moraiglmara i, yoba ta kugugl gagl wakai kaima edidre, ogo ring gol mina bekigwa i ama padigl idre, ede suna unan, te, goduglme yoba ta kugugl gagl kide edenan, ye ta akie ede suna ubr, <verse eid="JAS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3" />ene yagl ta kugugl gagl wakai kaima edugwa i kandre, ye di te, Ene u magigl, sia wakai i mina ame do didre, goduglme yoba di te, Ene yegl adigl moratno mo kaglno mina kimer yage ame do dibi, i kide panabuka. <verse eid="JAS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4" />Ene yegl dibi, enene meglmara suna i, yoba tau ake mitna edidre, tau ake atne edidre, erikwa mere yegl panabuka. Te, ene yegl eribi, ene nomane kide idre, yoba pere jasno munedi prikwa mere yegl paugwa.<verse eid="JAS 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5" />Agrama abarama wagle, na dena muduna suna meglkwa i, ene prio! Makandigle yoba ta erme goduglme meglkwa i, God di padigl, ye pre mediglkwa i u podo kaima enabiwe dugwa. Te, God yoba kingno morabara yoba taragl wakai wakai inaiglmara i, goduglme ama inaiglmedi di paduglkwa. Te, yoba ta deno muduno God tenaiglkwa yobama i, ama inaiglmedi di padigl kodugwa. <verse eid="JAS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6" />God ye goduglme yoba ere wakai ere tenagle dugwa ba ene pre mediglkwa yoba goduglme yoba agai goraiglmedi erikwa i, kide kaima erikwa. Yoba ta ene ere kide ere tedre, si kane sidre, ene gudu i pi kot mina edigwa i, goduglme ta erekrikwa. Mige podo ere neigwa yoba i keme yegl ere norikwa. <verse eid="JAS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7" />Te, Krais kagie wakai kaima yogo, ye kagie ene ama togwa i, mige podo kan neigwa yoba i keme di kide yei teigwa. Yegl pre ene mige kan neigwa yoba mogl mitna edimedi kanigwa i, kuno erekrukwa.<verse eid="JAS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8" />Ana Jisas nono kingno moglsre, ye kamo mina lo yegl ta padigl norukwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JAS 2:8">Ene enene wakai kanimere yegl, yoba ta magigl akie kipanaiglkwa i, ama yegl mere wakai kanio<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tawa Teigwa Yoba 19.18</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="JAS 2:8">dugwa. Ene lo i ka kaima duglo beglbi, ene wakai erikwa. <verse eid="JAS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9" />Ba ene yoba tau mogl mitna edigo, tau mogl atne edigo, erumedi kanibi, ene tadaglme erikwa. Te, ene yegl eribi, God lomo paugwa i, ene lo si biglke digwa yoba meglmedi i nogugl edenabuka. <verse eid="JAS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10" />I siragl pre yoba ta God lomo mudu duglo borabuka ba lo swara ta mina yage sinan, ye God lomo mudu si biglke dugwa mere yegl paugwa. <verse eid="JAS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11" />God swara ere mogl, Ene yagl abu ta bogl kunogl nekrio didre, ama Ene yoba ta si goglkrio<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isip Kide Kodigwa 20.13-14 ya Lo 5.17-18</char></note> dugwa. Yegl pre ene yagl abu ta bogl kunogl nekratnga ba yoba ta si gogln, ene God lomo si biglke dinga yoba motnga.<verse eid="JAS 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12" />Ana Krais nono okuo kan yubu sinabuka igne, ye lomo, nono kane pai dinaiglmedi ake ple di norukwa lomo i mina nono kan yubu sinabuka. Yegl pre ene ka dinaiglkwa ya mabuno eraiglkwa i, lo i mina nono kan yubu sinabukra we di prio. <verse eid="JAS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13" />Ana yoba ta erme yoba pere ta mitno goglkran, okuo God ye kan yubu sinabuka igne ye ama mirie ta goglkrabuka. I siragl pre God gumuglo mina yoba mitno geglkwa mabuno i, taragl podo pai, yoba ka tage teigwa mabuno i, egre togwa.<verse eid="JAS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba ta pre mediglsre, mabuno wakai ta erekran, ye pre meduglkwa i, mogo ta koglkrukwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14" />Ana agrama abarama wagle, yoba ta ere mogl, Krais pre medile dinabuka ba ye mabuno wakai ta pamere yoba bogl tekran, ye pre meduglmara i, ake ple di tekrabuka. <verse eid="JAS 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15" />Ene prio. Ene agro mo abaro swara ta kugugl gagl edenabuka ta yekran, kaya mokna nenabuka ama ta yekran, <verse eid="JAS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16" />ene ye kugugl gagl ya kaya mokna kwi ta tekre, ye ka yoko di tedre, Ene den mudun aragan eran, ede po didre, te, Ogon nagn niga dinan, kaya mokna mere no! dibi, ene yegl digwa i, ta ake ple di tekrukwa. <verse eid="JAS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17" />Kuno yegl mere yoba ta Krais pre medrabuka ba mabuno wakai ta pamere yoba bogl tekran, ye pre meduglkwa i mogo wakai ta koglkre, de sugwa mere yegl paugwa.<verse eid="JAS 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18" />Yegl paugwa ba yoba ta ere mogl yegl dinabuka, Ta manugwa. Yoba tau pre medraiglkwa ba yoba tau ama mabuno wakai boraiglme dinabuka. Ba na yegl dinaglka, Ene pre medigl, mabuno wakai ta boglkitn, na ene pre mediglnga mem i na siragl mere kanagle? Na mabuno wakai boglbo, na pre mediglka i nogugl panan, kanaiglme dinaglka. <verse eid="JAS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19" />Ene God swara moglmedi pre mediglnga i, wakai eriedi pitno? Pro! Murubuglo kide ama God moglmedi pre mediglsre, kudugl gogl, nagino nuglu digwa ba ye pre mediglmara mina mabuno wakai swara ta boglkrikwa. <verse eid="JAS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20" />Ene du etn kana. Ene pre mediglnga i mabuno wakai ta boglkitn, pre mediglnga i, de sugwa mere yegl pamedi pratnga.<verse eid="JAS 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21" />Nono kowano awano Abraham erukwa i, ene pro! Abraham ye wam Aisak i pi tawa bogl mina si gogl, God tawa tenagledi erukwa ege i, God kandre, Ene mabuno etnga i, mabuno du etniwe dugwa. <verse eid="JAS 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22" />Te, ene pre pogl sinatnga. Abraham God kamo pre meduglkwa i ya te wam si goragledi erukwa i mitna kogon koglo koglo eribriko, ye pre meduglkwa i, u gigle dugwa. <verse eid="JAS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23" />U gigle dugo, God kamo bage ta okna dugwa i, mogo koglkwa. God kamo yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JAS 2:23">Abraham ye God pre meduglko, God ye pre meduglkwa i kandre, yagl du moglmedi kanumiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oknayene Ibo 15.6</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="JAS 2:23">di, yegl dugwa. Te, Abraham erumara i mina ye God bogl si dakagl miuriwe dugwa. <verse eid="JAS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24" />Yegl pre ene pre pogl sinatnga i, God yoba ta wakai kandre, mabunomo du pame dinabuka i, ye pre medrabara swara i mitna ta manugwa ba ye pre mediglsre, te, mabuno wakai borabara i, suo akie kogon koglo koglo eribr, kaima kuno erabuka.<verse eid="JAS 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25" />Te, konbauna abu ta kagie Rahap we digwa ikra, Israel yagl suo ye dumo Jeriko doko daka ere kanabugledi ubriko, Rahap yagl suo i, i yugugl edidre, suglno mogl, okuo konbo ta mina ede piro dugwa. Abu erumara i mina God ye mabunomo ama du pamedi kanugwa.<verse eid="JAS 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26" />Ana ka ebrie yoba kia ta ogo nagie kide kodinan, kia ta moglkrukwa pre ye ogo nagie goglkwa. Kuno yegl mere yoba ta pre medrabuka ba mabuno wakai ta boglkran, ye yoba ta goglko, ogo nagie taragl yoko yomere mere yegl, ye pre meduglkwa i goglko, u taragl yoko ogwa.<verse eid="JAS 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3" />
  <para style="s">Nono drano sugl wakai moramga paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1" />Ana agrama wagle, ene tau mere tabre God kamo beke tenamga yoba moramnedi erekrio. I siragl pre God kamo yoba beke tomga yobamo ta munga i, nono mabunono ya kano i, God swara kaima ta kanige erekre, mudu kan yubu sinabuka.<verse eid="JAS 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2" />Nono mudu munga i, mabuno tau mere mina yage sumga, ba ege mere ka dumnara i mina yage sikramga. Yoba ta ye dra sugl wakai moglsre, ka dumara yage sikrukwa ta morabuka i, ye yake ede kade pi kodugwa mere yegl paugwa pre ye ogo nagie mudu ama sugl wakai morabuka i, kuno erabuka.<verse eid="JAS 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Horse and bridle" file="hk00029b.tif" size="col" copy="Horace Knowles, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="3.3" />Ana yoba hos au sidre ede eigwa i, ene prio. Ain kebra ta hos drano mina padiglsre, kane kogl, stia mere yegl akigo, hos ye kano pre, ta enaiglmedi erimara i, ede eigwa. <verse eid="JAS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4" />Te, yoba sip stia akigwa i, ama prio. Sip i taragl podo kide ta yogo, ir podo kide mage, ake nu sugwa ba yoba ta stia kebra akumara i mina, sip ye enabedi prumara i, ede ogwa. <verse eid="JAS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5" />Kuno yegl mere, nono ogono nagino podo pamara suna i, drano taragl kebra ta paugwa ba nono drano i, mogl mitna edidre, ka kane kane dugwa taragl paugwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 3:5">Ana ene prio! Doga kebra ta denabuka ba de wir di, ede pi kono are denabuka. <verse eid="JAS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6" />Kuno yegl mere, nono drano i, doga bauglo mere yegl ere, taragl mere kide ere kide ere togwa. Nono drano i mina taragl kide kane kane atne kau sugwa. Te, nono ogono nagino mudu i, drano swara ede okna pi, aglau ersre, ogono nagino mudu si deglbi yogwa mere yegl paugwa. Drano swara i eruko, nono mogl pai erumga i, mudu u kide ogwa. Te, nono drano i, doga bauglo mere yegl dome diga i, Satan yene doga i, ere gaglkwa mere yegl paugwa.<verse eid="JAS 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7" />Ana yoba ere mogl, agl bugla kane kane ere kiglko, taragl i yoba kano prikwa. Te, kua ya gur toki ya nigle taragl kane kane meglkwa i, yoba ama ere kuglsre, suglno meglkwa <verse eid="JAS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8" />ba yoba swara ta ere mogl, yene dra sugl wakai moglsre, ka prabedi erabuka i, kuno ta erekrabuka. Are ere pai morabuka. Nono drano i, mogl atne edekre, ka kide keme dinagledi prukwa mere yegl paugwa. Marasin kide, yoba ne geglkwa i, nono drano mina kau sugwa mere yegl paugwa.<verse eid="JAS 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9" />Nono drano mina Neno Kade, nono Yaglno Kade moglkwa i, di wakai yei tedre, te drano swara i mina yoba, God ye moglmere mere yegl moraiglmedi beke yogwa i, di kide yei tomga. <verse eid="JAS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10" />Nono drano swara i mina ka kide ya wakai akie ede meda ugwa. Agrama abarama wagle, nono mabuno yegl ta erekramga paugwa. <verse eid="JAS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11" />Nigl swara ta ogo beinabara i, nigl kide ya nigl wakai akie ta ede meda ukrabrika. <verse eid="JAS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12" />Te, agrama abarama wagle, ede muli edie popo mogo koran, kuno erabo? Mo, amugl ta bata mogo korabuka i, kuno erabo? Kuno ta erekrabuka. Te, mudi nigl moglmara i, nigl kor ama akie ta moglkrabuka. Kuno yegl mere, nono drano swara i mina, ka wakai ya ka kide akie ede meda ugwa i, kuno ta erekrukwa.<verse eid="JAS 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">God nomane wakai norukwa i, yegl mere paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13" />Ana ene tau nomano wakai pamedi pribi, ene mogl atne edidre, mabuno wakai eraiglmara i mina, nomano wakai i, i nogugl edenaiglkwa paugwa. Yegl eribi, ene mabunono wakai i, yoba kandre, ene nomano wakai pamedi kanaiglkwa. <verse eid="JAS 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14" />Ba ene nomano mina enene pre i mitna edidre, yoba tau kide kan, jelas ere tebi, ene aglau ere kodigwa pre enene kagno ake mitna edidre, no nomano wakai pamiwe dikrio! Ene yegl dibi, ene ka kaima paugwa i kide kodidre, ka kibi digwa. <verse eid="JAS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15" />Yoba ta mabuno yegl ersre, nomana podo pamedi prabuka i, nono pre pogl sinamga. Ye nomanemo i, God ta tekrukwa. Ye makandigle yoba nomano idre, yene nomanemo ama duglo boglsre, murubuglo kide nomano pamere yegl paugwa. <verse eid="JAS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16" />Te, ene prio. Yoba yene pre i mitna edidre, jelas erikwa igne i ye mogl pai erikwa i, u kide ogo, mabuno kide mudu ye meglmara plau dugwa.<verse eid="JAS 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17" />Ba God yoba ta nomane wakai tenan, inabuka i, ye mabuno wakai tau mere erabuka. Ye mabuno swara ta erabuka podo paugwa i, mabuno tau pe sugwa i ere morabuka. Te, ye ama yoba pere bogl deno muduno swara yenamnedi ersre, ye wakai moraiglmedi prisre, ye kano ama prabuka. Ye yegl ersre, te, yoba pere ege ege mitno goglsre, ere wakai ere tenabuka. Te, ye ama yoba mudu mabuno swara ere tedre, yoba gumuglnomugl keme mabuno wakai eragledi erekrabuka ba ege ege erabuka. <verse eid="JAS 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18" />Te, yoba ta yoba pere bogl deno muduno swara yenamnedi erikwa i, ye kaya mokna yubo i pi sudiglkwa mere yegl paugwa. I siragl pre ye erimara i, mabuno du ya mabuno wakai okuo pare ede mitna pidre, yake ede podo enabuka.<verse eid="JAS 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4" />
  <para style="s">Makandigle yoba mabunono i, yoba ta wakai kanan, ye God kudamo ikne mere yegl moglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1" />Ana ene ikne ikne nonga didre, kuda mere yegl beglkwa i, ene mem ta primo mo prikrime? Na ene di tenaglka. Ene taragl tau ersre, erme keme gun yenaiglkwa i, nomano mina kau sugwa pre nomane kide i, ene deno muduno suna kuda bogl togo, ene nomane kide idre, ikne ikne nonga di, kuda mere yegl beglkwa. <verse eid="JAS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2" />Ene taragl tau bubuno goglsre, yoba pere jelas ere teigwa ba ene taragl ta inamnedi prikwa i, ikrikwa pre ene aglke kor nonga didre, kuda mere yegl bogl, agroma abaroma ikne ikne si geglkwa mere yegl paugwa. Ba ene taragl tau ikrikwa i, i siragl pre ene God agle di prikrikwa. <verse eid="JAS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3" />Te, ege tau ene God agle di prikwa ba ye ene di primere mere ere tekrukwa. I siragl pre ene nomane wakai idre, taragl wakai pre God agle di prikrikwa ba ene erme keme gun yenamnedi prisre, God agle di prikwa pre ye ene dimere ere tekrukwa.<verse eid="JAS 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4" />Ana ene mabuno yegl erikwa i, ene kide erikwa. Ene abu ta bogl kunogl neigwa mere yegl paugwa. Ene prio! Makandigle yoba ebrie mabunono i, yoba ta wakai kanan, ye God kudamo ikne mere yegl moglkwa. <verse eid="JAS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5" />God kamo di norukwa i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JAS 4:5">God ye Murubuglomo noruko, suna moglkwa i, no ye moglmara swara mogl atne edinaiglmedi prumiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isip Kide Kodigwa 20.5, 34.14</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="JAS 4:5">di, yegl di norukwa. God kamo yegl dugwa i, yoko di yar edumedi primo? Ta manugwa. Mem paugwa pre dugwa.<verse eid="JAS 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6" />Ana nono ege mere nomane kide imga ba God mitno podo goglsre, ake ple di noragledi prukwa. Mabuno i pre ye kamo mina bage ta yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JAS 4:6">Yoba ta mogl mitna edenabuka i, God ye ake atne edenabuka ba yoba ta mogl atne edenabuka i, God ye ere wakai ere tenabiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ame Wakai Dinaiglkwa 3.34</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="JAS 4:6">dugwa. <verse eid="JAS 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7" />Yegl pre ene God moglmara mogl atne edidre, yagl kide bakagl noro dinabedi adigl gigledi molo! Ene yegl eribi, yagl kide ene meglmara kide kodo, teke ede enabuka.<verse eid="JAS 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8" />Ene God moglmara mogl magigl edio! Ene God moglmara mogl magigl edibi, ye ama ene meglmara mogl magigl edenabuka. Yoba ogono nigl edimere yegl, ene tadaglme erikwa i, i pi kide kodio! Te, ene yoba ta nomano suo yenabuka i, nomano kide, i pi kide kodibi, deno muduno pe sinabuka. <verse eid="JAS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9" />Ene tadaglmeno pre kide prisre, kai erio! Ene gun yedre, gaugl erikwa i kodo, deno muduno yubun denan, kai eraiglkwa paugwa. <verse eid="JAS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10" />Ene yegl ersre, Yaglno Kade moglmara mogl atne edibi, yene ere mogl, ene ake mitna edenabuka.<verse eid="JAS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Agroma abaroma ka kide ta di tekramga paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11" />Ana agrama abarama wagle, ene ka kide ikne ikne dikrio! Yoba ta ye agigle ka kide di tedre, ye kan yubu sugwa i, ye mogl mitna edidre, God lomo kan yubu sugwa mere yegl paugwa. Te, ye God lomo ama dumere erekrukwa ba God lomo di kide yei togwa mere yegl paugwa. <verse eid="JAS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12" />God swara lo ere padigl norsre, ye swara jasno moglkwa. God yoba ta wakai morabedi ake ple dinabo mo ye si gorabo mo i, ye moglmara paugwa. Ba ene agro tau jasno moramnedi erikwa i, ene ira munedi prime? Mabuno i kide kodio.<verse eid="JAS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">No nono prumnere mere kogon tau eramne dumun, kide panabuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13" />Ana ene prio! Ene tau digwa i, Erme mo tagna no ede pi dumo yegl, yegl pidre, bugla yugu swara mere dumo i mogl, kogon tau ersre, mige kia tau inamniwe digwa. <verse eid="JAS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14" />Ene yegl digwa ba taragl ta tagna plau dinabuka i, ene ta pre kan erekrikwa. Tagna mogl kamun kua sugwa ba ade sugwa igne, kamun kua pigla baglmere yegl, ene ama ege sugunagle moglsre, goraiglkwa. Ene aunake goraiglkwa i ta prikrikwa. <verse eid="JAS 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15" />Yegl pre ene ka ta dibi, kuno erabuka i, yegl dinaiglkwa, Yagl Kade ta wakai pran, no kor moglsre, kogon yegl, yegl eramniwe di, yegl dinaiglkwa paugwa. <verse eid="JAS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16" />Ba erme ene mogl mitna edidre, enene primere mere yegl eramne digwa i, wakai ta paikrukwa. Ene mogl mitna edigwa i, mabuno kide erikwa.<verse eid="JAS 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17" />Ana yoba ta mabuno wakai swara ta erabuka panan, ye pre kan ersre, mabuno wakai i ta erekran, ye tadaglme erukwa.<verse eid="JAS 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5" />
  <para style="s">Yoba tau erme mige moni mere kan neigwa i, okuo topo kide inaiglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1" />Ana ene yoba mige moni mere kan neigwa i, prio! Ene okuo yubun podo inaiglkwa pre ene kai ersre, kai giglage sinaiglkwa paugwa. <verse eid="JAS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2" />Ene bona ganano bugl kide eran, gunage ama ene kuguglno gaglno ne kodinaiglkwa. <verse eid="JAS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3" />Te, ene gol ya silva kan neigwa i, ouno edidre, u marasin kide mere yegl enan, marasin kide i, doga mere yegl dedre, ene ogono nagino gagl tege erabuka. Taragl yegl plau dinan, ene mabunono kide nogugl kaima panan, yoba kanaiglkwa. Taragl mudu dudunabuka ege i, ede magigl ugo, ene moni ya bona gana makai si meglkwa pre ene aglau erikwa. <verse eid="JAS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4" />Ene prio! Ene yoba tau di tedre, no makano mina kogon ere norio digo, ye ene kogono ere tedre, kaya mokna tau si yuigwa ba ene topo tenamne digwa i tekre, ye topono ene ake meglkwa i, Yagl Kade agle di moglkwa mere yegl paugo, kogon yoba i ama agle digo, Yagl Kade prukwa pre Yagl Kade, ye amimo mere kide meglkwa i prisre, ene kide erimara i, ere te ikne edenabuka paugwa. <verse eid="JAS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5" />Ene makandigle mogl, taragl wakai wakai idre, ame wakai kaima digwa. God ene si gorabuka ege i, ede magigl ugwa ba ene enene nomano primere ere wan meglkwa. <verse eid="JAS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6" />Yoba tau mabunono du paugwa i, ene ye kot ere tedre, si goglsre, erikwa ba ye ene si kegl dinamnedi erekre, yubun yoko igwa. Yegl pre ene yubun podo kaima inaiglkwa paugwa.<verse eid="JAS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yubun idre, adigl gigledi moramga paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7" />Ana agrama abarama wagle, taragl yegl mere okuo plau dinabuka pre ene yubun ta inaiglmara i, adigl gigledi molo. Ene adigl gigledi mogl ebi, Yagl Kade unabuka. Yoba kaya mokna ere yaiglkwa igne, ye kaya mokna wakai borabedi sugl meglmere mere yegl, ene ama sugl moraiglkwa paugwa. Ade de, kamun si, erabedi ye sugl mogl eigo, kaya mokna okuo boglkwa. <verse eid="JAS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8" />Kuno yegl mere ene ama adigl gigledi mogl, Yagl Kade unabedi sugl moraiglkwa paugwa. I siragl pre ye unabuka igne i ede magigl ugwa.<verse eid="JAS 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9" />Ana agrama abarama wagle, ene meglmara suna i, enene ikne ikne ka tedre, ka kane kane dikrio! Ene ka kane kane di meglbi, God ene jasno mere mogl, ene ka tage te dinabuka pre diga. Jasno ede magigl udre, yugu dua mina adigl moglkwa mere yegl paugwa.<verse eid="JAS 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10" />Agrama abarama wagle, God kamo kep yoba okna meglkwa i, ene prio. Ye Yagl Kade dra idre, ka dimara i yoba ye ere kide ere teigo, ye yubun igwa. Ye yubun igwa ba ye adigl gigledi meglkwa. Ene ye erikwa i poglo di prisre, erimere yegl ama erio. <verse eid="JAS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11" />Ana yoba yubun idre, adigl gigledi meglkwa yobamo i pre nono yegl dumga, God ye erikwa i, wakai kanugwa pre gun yeimiwe dumga. Te, Jop kamo i, ene prikwa. Jop yubun idre, adigl gigledi moglko, okuo Yagl Kade ye mogl pai erukwa i, u wakai kaima enabedi ere togwa. I siragl pre Yagl Kade ye ege ege nono mitno goglsre, ere wakai ere norukwa yagle moglkwa.<verse eid="JAS 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ka gigledi promis ta erekramga paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12" />Agrama abarama wagle, ene taragl podo ta eraiglkwa paugwa i, yegl paugwa, ene owo ta dinaiglkwa panan, owo dio. Te, ene mane ta dinaiglkwa panan, ene mane dio. Ba ene yoba pere ka gigledi di te padiglkrio. Ene ka gigledi dumniwedi heven kagie daglsre, dumo makan kagie daglsre, taragl pere ta ama kagie daglkrio! Na ka dikrio diga i di meglbi, God ene ka tage te dinabuka pre diga.<verse eid="JAS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">God yobuglomo pre medigl moglsre, kamage eramga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13" />Ana ene meglmara suna i, yoba ta yubun inan, ye kamage erabuka paugwa. Te, yoba ta gun yenan, ye giglage didre, God di wakai yei tenabuka paugwa. <verse eid="JAS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14" />Te, yoba ta kide sinan, ye ene suglno yoba ta moraiglkwa i agle dinan, ye udre, kugo nuglo tau toide bre mina edidre, Yagl Kade kagie mina ye pre kamage eraiglkwa paugwa. <verse eid="JAS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15" />Yoba ta kide sugwa i, Yagl Kade ye ere wakai ere tenabedi pre mediglsre, kamage eribi, Yagl Kade yoba ta kide sugwa i, ere wakai ere tenan, kidemo bu yenabuka. Te, yoba i tadaglme ta erukwa panan, Yagl Kade ye tadaglmemo kide kodo tenabuka. <verse eid="JAS 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16" />Yegl pre kide ene sinan, ene kideno bu yenabedi pribi, ene tadaglme erikwa i, ikne ikne di poglsre, kamage ikne ikne eraiglkwa paugwa. Yoba du ta morabuka i, kamage eran, ye kamagemo i, yobuglomo panabuka pre ye kamage erabara i, taragl podo plau dinabuka.<verse eid="JAS 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17" />Elaija okna moglkwa i, ene prio. Ye nono yoba munere mere kuno yegl moglkwa ba ye kamun si dinabedi kamage eruko, bugla yugu suota ya ba 6-pela kamun sikrukwa. <verse eid="JAS 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18" />Te, okuo ye aglke kor kamun sinabedi kamage eruko, kamun sugo, kaya mokna aglke kor boglkwa.<verse eid="JAS 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Agro ta konbo wakai kide kodinan, nono ye ake ple di tenamga paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19" />Agrama abarama wagle, ene swarano ta God kamo kaima paugwa i kide kodo, ede eglke enan, ye agigle ta pi, ye auro i ede ikne unan, <verse eid="JAS 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20" />ye wakai erukwa. Ene prio. Ene agro ta tadaglme ere moran, yoba ta ye konbo kide duglo bogl moglmedi kandre, auro i ede ikne unan, ye agigle i gogl dinabedi ere yugwa. Te, ye agre ikne umara i mina ye agigle tadaglme mere kide erukwa i, God si bi di tedre, kide kodo tenabuka pre ye agre ikne umara i, wakai erukwa.<verse eid="JAS 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5" />
</usx>